    <edge source="&quot;ARISTOTLE UNIVERSITY OF THESSALONIKI&quot;" target="&quot;JOURNAL OF EDUCATIONAL RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A study published in the Journal of Educational Research and Development found that students who studied abroad, like José Blanco F., demonstrated higher levels of academic achievement and cultural competence compared to their peers who did not have international educational experiences."</data>
      <data key="d5">"research impact, international education"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0432</data>
